    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stylish 2-Bedroom First-Floor Apartment \r\nSituated within the well-maintained and highly sought-after Phibblestown House development, this bright and spacious first-floor apartment offers comfortable modern living in a convenient location.\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generous open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms with excellent storage, and a contemporary family bathroom. Large windows provide an abundance of natural light, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere throughout.\r\nThe property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors, or those looking to downsize, benefiting from secure access, designated parking, and landscaped communal areas. Its excellent location offers easy access to local shops, schools, parks, public transport links, and major road networks, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas straightforward."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: with laminate wood floor, alarm control panel and storage closet/hotpress \r\n\r\nLounge: open plan with laminate wood floor, TV point and patio door to south facing balcony overlooking green area \r\n4.2x6.6m\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\nKitchen Area: with modern fitted kitchen with wall and floor mounted units, tiled splash-back,  under-counter lighting, laminate wood floor, oven and hob, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher      \t\t\t       \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1:  double bedroom with fitted wardrobe and laminate wood floor, patio door to Juliet balcony overlooking walled garden\t\t\r\n4.2x3.0m\t\t\t\t\t       \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: double bedroom laminate wood floor \t\r\n2.7x3.7m\r\n\r\nDressing Room:  with fitted shelves and rails, laminate wood floor \r\n1.5x1.8m \r\n\t\t\t\t       \r\nBathroom: with bath, W.C, W.H.B, fully tiled walls and tiled floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nSouth facing balcony overlooking green area  \r\nCommunal car-parking \r\nLandscaped gardens including green and private walled gardens  \t\t\t\r\n\r\nServices\r\nGFCH \r\nFully alarmed          \t\t\t\t\r\nPVC double glazed windows\r\nIntercom system \r\nAnnual Service Charge c. €2,200"
